    "name": "Wigged Out",
    "steam_appid": 1176060,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge into Wigged Out, the historically inaccurate ball game where absurdity reigns and chaos is the name of the game!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/7ac1d3cf881f079e5fbe1fdc139c4f1d.avif?t=1742370587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put on your finest wig and dive into the action in this hilarious party game where dodgeball meets football like never before! Use wacky items\u2014or even your own wig\u2014to knock the big ball into your opponent\u2019s goal! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/75286c1dfe0b13c057ba8bb3d025f013.poster.avif?t=1742370587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/75286c1dfe0b13c057ba8bb3d025f013.webm?t=1742370587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/63deda04591926202bfd908f10fa52f6.avif?t=1742370587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be on guard! The big ball isn't the only target in Wigged Out, you are too. Keep an eye on your opponents, or risk getting knocked down. And if that isn't enough, the environment is also out to get you, so watch out for exploding manholes and rampaging goats!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/e3922d84a0f46d168771976017e3b316.poster.avif?t=1742370587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/e3922d84a0f46d168771976017e3b316.webm?t=1742370587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/4503277a3a370524e769701587ef6154.avif?t=1742370587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from six quirky characters, each with a unique WigOut power. Charge up your WigOut bar and unleash total mayhem on the pitch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/d1cfdd710dc764596c00388da1072e21.poster.avif?t=1742370587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/d1cfdd710dc764596c00388da1072e21.webm?t=1742370587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/28028b52956e43c857650ae453bcbd5a.avif?t=1742370587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play across 80+ colorful levels set in three diverse areas! Battle it out on <i>The Campus</i>, with lush lawns and busy streets. Head to <i>The Countryside</i>, where angry goats roam and alien invasions might occur. Or take on <i>The Country Fair</i>, where you could find yourself in a giant game of pinball!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/8e6dd647f414646985d85953ac66f597.poster.avif?t=1742370587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/8e6dd647f414646985d85953ac66f597.webm?t=1742370587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/5fe136daa83e0ad5183a9737c105a5d6.avif?t=1742370587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play locally or online for non-stop fun\u2014or add some bots if that\u2019s more your style!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/7f9944af682fea8c0e2c518260635275.poster.avif?t=1742370587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/7f9944af682fea8c0e2c518260635275.webm?t=1742370587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;WIG FLINGING FRENZY\u201d -</strong> Make use of various wacky items\u2014or even your own wig\u2014to launch the big ball into your opponent's goal! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STAY ON HIGH ALERT! \u2013</strong> It\u2019s not just your opponents you need to worry about. Watch out for bursting hydrants, exploding manholes, and a rampaging school mascot goat! Danger lurks at every turn. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNLEASH YOUR WIGOUT POWER! \u2013</strong> Charge up your character\u2019s unique ability and unleash total chaos on the pitch! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CONQUER 80+ LEVELS! \u2013</strong>Explore vibrant arenas, tackle wild challenges, and master an ever-changing mix of items, hazards, and goal types. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNLEASH HILARITY! \u2013</strong> Play locally or online for non-stop fun\u2014or add some bots if that\u2019s more your style!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge into Wigged Out, the historically inaccurate ball game where absurdity reigns and chaos is the name of the game!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/7ac1d3cf881f079e5fbe1fdc139c4f1d.avif?t=1742370587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put on your finest wig and dive into the action in this hilarious party game where dodgeball meets football like never before! Use wacky items\u2014or even your own wig\u2014to knock the big ball into your opponent\u2019s goal! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/75286c1dfe0b13c057ba8bb3d025f013.poster.avif?t=1742370587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/75286c1dfe0b13c057ba8bb3d025f013.webm?t=1742370587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/63deda04591926202bfd908f10fa52f6.avif?t=1742370587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be on guard! The big ball isn't the only target in Wigged Out, you are too. Keep an eye on your opponents, or risk getting knocked down. And if that isn't enough, the environment is also out to get you, so watch out for exploding manholes and rampaging goats!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/e3922d84a0f46d168771976017e3b316.poster.avif?t=1742370587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/e3922d84a0f46d168771976017e3b316.webm?t=1742370587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/4503277a3a370524e769701587ef6154.avif?t=1742370587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from six quirky characters, each with a unique WigOut power. Charge up your WigOut bar and unleash total mayhem on the pitch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/d1cfdd710dc764596c00388da1072e21.poster.avif?t=1742370587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/d1cfdd710dc764596c00388da1072e21.webm?t=1742370587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/28028b52956e43c857650ae453bcbd5a.avif?t=1742370587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play across 80+ colorful levels set in three diverse areas! Battle it out on <i>The Campus</i>, with lush lawns and busy streets. Head to <i>The Countryside</i>, where angry goats roam and alien invasions might occur. Or take on <i>The Country Fair</i>, where you could find yourself in a giant game of pinball!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/8e6dd647f414646985d85953ac66f597.poster.avif?t=1742370587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/8e6dd647f414646985d85953ac66f597.webm?t=1742370587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/5fe136daa83e0ad5183a9737c105a5d6.avif?t=1742370587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play locally or online for non-stop fun\u2014or add some bots if that\u2019s more your style!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/7f9944af682fea8c0e2c518260635275.poster.avif?t=1742370587\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176060/extras/7f9944af682fea8c0e2c518260635275.webm?t=1742370587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;WIG FLINGING FRENZY\u201d -</strong> Make use of various wacky items\u2014or even your own wig\u2014to launch the big ball into your opponent's goal! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STAY ON HIGH ALERT! \u2013</strong> It\u2019s not just your opponents you need to worry about. Watch out for bursting hydrants, exploding manholes, and a rampaging school mascot goat! Danger lurks at every turn. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNLEASH YOUR WIGOUT POWER! \u2013</strong> Charge up your character\u2019s unique ability and unleash total chaos on the pitch! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CONQUER 80+ LEVELS! \u2013</strong>Explore vibrant arenas, tackle wild challenges, and master an ever-changing mix of items, hazards, and goal types. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNLEASH HILARITY! \u2013</strong> Play locally or online for non-stop fun\u2014or add some bots if that\u2019s more your style!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In Wigged Out, two rival schools clash in a wild and wacky ball game! Dodge, jump, and attack\u2014whether by launching a rubber turkey at your foes or netting a goal while riding a goat. Chaos and skill go hand in hand in this fast-paced, laugh-out-loud showdown!",
